        // Who fights with a KINETIC body: NPCs, and (CREATURE-02 tier 1, user
        // 11-01) the armed bipedal creatures - skeletons, dremora, golden
        // saints and liches, 41 records on the human skeleton and animations
        // (biped and weapon flags). Vivec (biped, no inventory) and the
        // creatures on their own skeletons stay animated (tier 2, deferred).
        // OPENMW_RAGDOLL_CREATURE_BIPEDS = 0: NPCs only.
        static bool kineticHumanoid(const MWWorld::ConstPtr& ptr)
        {
            if (ptr.isEmpty())
                return false;
            if (ptr.getClass().isNpc())
                return true;
